Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.600
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.600
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:28.400
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:28.400
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:34.230
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:34.230
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:57.590
<i>Taichi...</i>

00:02:06.350 --> 00:02:07.570
Taichi...

00:02:07.570 --> 00:02:10.020
Agumon, you okay?

00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:14.950
Yeah... I can still fight, Taichi.

00:02:14.950 --> 00:02:18.990
Right... we can still fight!

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:47.680
Taichi...

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:50.520
Taichi!

00:02:57.820 --> 00:03:00.410
<i>The new darkness, Millenniumon.</i>

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:04.370
<i>This dark power had swallowed
the Chosen Ones.</i>

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:09.130
<i>And with no means to resist, the world
was about to fall into darkness.</i>

00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:10.420
<i>However...</i>

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:13.920
<i>The battle is not over yet...</i>

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:21.430
THE END, THE ULTIMATE HOLY BATTLE

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:28.430
Millenniumon's existence
is a corruption of the Digital World.

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:33.530
At this rate, all of us as well as
this world will fade into darkness.

00:03:33.530 --> 00:03:34.900
The children...

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:38.280
Are the Chosen Ones safe?

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:39.690
I do not know.

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:42.240
<i>Oh, Holy Digimon...</i>

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:47.700
<i>Without your awakenings,
this battle will not...</i>

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:52.160
We're still alive?

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:54.170
Takeru!

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:56.260
My body's heavy...

00:03:56.260 --> 00:03:57.880
Where are we?

00:03:57.880 --> 00:03:59.710
This is most likely...

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:05.220
