compressed by Millenniumon.

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:07.350
At this rate,

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:12.730
we will continue to fall deep into
infinite darkness without ever perishing.

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:15.110
Isn't that really bad?

00:04:15.110 --> 00:04:18.110
But we haven't lost yet!

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:21.120
Everybody saw that light, right?!

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:23.610
Yes, that's probably...

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:25.740
Wargreymon...

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:28.450
My brother's back!

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:41.140
Millenniumon... what a massive size.

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:43.170
No wonder the world could end!

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:44.810
Taichi!

00:04:44.810 --> 00:04:45.890
Yeah!

00:04:45.890 --> 00:04:48.270
Everyone's inside that black orb!

00:04:48.270 --> 00:04:51.640
Millenniumon's gonna
crush them all together!

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:53.810
Let's go, Taichi!

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:04.530
Hold on, everyone!

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:06.410
We'll save you no matter what!

00:05:56.790 --> 00:05:58.590
This is horrifying...

00:05:58.590 --> 00:06:00.300
If we don't do something,

00:06:00.300 --> 00:06:03.550
