and the Digital World!

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:11.050
-So heavy!
-My whole body feels crushed!

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:17.060
This dimension's data
is being compressed extremely fast!

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:19.310
Hikari!

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:21.560
Takeru...

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:24.150
We have to trust Taichi for now!

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:25.530
Let's go, Gabumon!

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:26.570
Okay!

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:40.710
Metalgarurumon!

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:46.340
Cocytus Breath!

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:54.390
Is this wall breakable?

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:57.100
The compression slowed down?!

00:06:57.520 --> 00:07:01.360
Right! If you produce lots of data,
it'll take longer to compress!

00:07:01.360 --> 00:07:02.480
I see!

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:03.860
We can buy time!

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:05.860
Let's do what we can!

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:10.370
As long as Taichi doesn't give up,

00:07:10.370 --> 00:07:13.370
we won't give up either!

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:21.120
<i>Everyone holds the heart of a warrior...
I cannot lose either.</i>

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:24.880
Oh, Tailmon?!

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:25.880
Patamon?!

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:27.240
I am...

00:07:27.240 --> 00:07:28.510
I am...

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:30.130
the Holy Digimon!

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:33.100
The ones to lead the warriors...

00:07:33.100 --> 00:07:35.390
And to repel darkness together!

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:38.390
We shall fight till the end as well!

00:08:13.630 --> 00:08:15.050
Just a little more!

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:28.950
Darn it! Millenniumon's big and fast!

00:08:28.950 --> 00:08:30.150
Taichi!

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:31.190
Huh?!

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:49.470
At this rate...

00:08:49.470 --> 00:08:50.590
Taichi!

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:51.840
-Taichi-san!
-Taichi-kun!

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:53.220
-Taichi!
-Taichi-san!

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:54.390
Taichi-san!

00:08:54.390 --> 00:08:55.590
Taichi!

00:09:04.690 --> 00:09:06.780
<i>Don't ever give up!</i>

00:09:06.780 --> 00:09:09.110
<i>Taichi!</i>

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:10.950
<i>-Taichi-san!
-Taichi-kun!</i>

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:12.490
<i>Taichi-san!</i>

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:13.900
<i>Taichi!</i>

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:15.780
<i>Taichi!</i>

00:09:17.610 --> 00:09:19.870
-Taichi!
-Taichi-san!

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:27.370
Are these... everyone's hopes?

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:32.630
Their hopes became a light that powers us!

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:54.780
Brave Shield!

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:05.000
Brave Tornado!

00:10:29.770 --> 00:10:33.400
Holyangemon Mega Evolution!

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:39.860
Angewomon Mega Evolution!

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:53.170
Goddramon!

00:10:56.510 --> 00:10:59.680
Holydramon!

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:03.560
The light of hope!

00:11:03.560 --> 00:11:07.060
So this is the Holy Digimon's powers...

00:11:07.730 --> 00:11:09.100
The powers...

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:11.560
to save the world!

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:28.420
This is?

00:11:28.420 --> 00:11:30.330
-Taichi!
-Taichi-san!

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:32.710
Sora! Koshiro!

00:11:32.710 --> 00:11:34.090
Where are we?

00:11:34.090 --> 00:11:37.300
A dimension created
by Holydramon and Hikari-san!

00:11:37.760 --> 00:11:38.800
Hikari?

00:11:40.670 --> 00:11:41.470
<i>Taichi!</i>

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:42.430
Yamato!

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:43.520
Thank goodness!

00:11:43.520 --> 00:11:45.180
That was close!

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:48.310
Takeru and Hikari's Digimon...

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:51.190
Holyangemon and Angewomon...

00:11:51.190 --> 00:11:53.060
The Holy Digimon...

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:55.770
