00:11:56.770 --> 00:12:01.320
Everyone's power has built up hope
and became a light!

00:11:58.070 --> 00:12:01.280
GODDRAMON

00:12:01.820 --> 00:12:06.330
And it has caused a miracle,
leading us to an unprecedented evolution.

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:06.280
HOLYDRAMON

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:12.340
Let's go, Goddramon!

00:12:12.340 --> 00:12:13.960
Holydramon!

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:33.830
So it's begun...

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:38.330
The battle to decide the fate
of the Digital World.

00:13:45.590 --> 00:13:47.300
Goddramon!

00:13:47.590 --> 00:13:49.640
Holydramon!

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:56.310
God Flame!

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:01.520
Holy Flame!

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:25.170
What an intense battle!

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:46.370
They melted?!

00:14:46.370 --> 00:14:48.990
Yes, if they're hit by that much heat.

00:14:54.450 --> 00:14:57.500
