00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:22.940
Away with you, Millenniumon!

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:26.360
The holy light, Apocalypse!

00:16:10.940 --> 00:16:11.780
What?

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:31.800
