00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:05.420
At this rate...

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:20.680
Everyone, look! Tiny lights!

00:17:23.180 --> 00:17:24.440
Aren't these...

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:25.900
What's this?

00:17:25.900 --> 00:17:27.230
I know!

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:31.780
It's the same light as before,
the light of hope!

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:33.030
It's alive...

00:17:34.450 --> 00:17:37.820
The ground... the Digital World.

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:43.160
<i>Is it saying it will fight
alongside the Chosen Ones?</i>

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:49.340
Taichi!

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:55.220
Wargreymon!

00:17:55.800 --> 00:17:58.590
Yeah! Let's do it, Taichi!

00:18:08.690 --> 00:18:11.860
Gaia Force!

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:15.990
This isn't enough!

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:22.990
What's this?!

00:18:23.490 --> 00:18:27.000
The spirit to never give up...
The spirit to believe...

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:34.010
That light is hope!
It will become their power!

00:18:34.010 --> 00:18:35.760
Let us send it to them!

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:40.260
<i>Send the light of hope to the Chosen Ones!</i>

00:18:43.390 --> 00:18:46.520
I feel an incredibly tremendous power!

00:18:48.770 --> 00:18:49.770
Let's do it!

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:56.530
Gaia Force!

00:19:22.850 --> 00:19:27.270
Now is the time to settle this battle
from the ancient past!

00:19:28.520 --> 00:19:31.770
Let us entrust you
with our powers as well!

00:19:44.780 --> 00:19:50.330
<i>This light is the fire we lit in all
the Digimon's hearts we've met up to now.</i>

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:54.840
<i>The light of hope that was given
to all the Digimon.</i>

00:19:55.460 --> 00:19:58.590
<i>The Digital World... Everyone...</i>

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:14.810
We'll never let Millenniumon return
with all the power we have!

00:20:40.550 --> 00:20:42.510
Taichi!

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:46.520
Hikari! Everybody!

00:20:46.520 --> 00:20:47.600
Taichi!

00:20:48.060 --> 00:20:50.100
I'm so glad you're safe!

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:53.640
Hikari... thanks.

00:20:55.600 --> 00:20:59.150
All of your voices gave me courage.

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:07.250
Agumon!

00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:08.990
Hikari!

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:33.140
<i>The border has now begun to blend</i>

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:33.140
<i>ima mazari atteku border</i>

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:35.980
<i>"It's uncharted territory from here!"</i>

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:35.980
<i>koko kara wa jinrui mitou desu!</i>

00:21:36.150 --> 00:21:38.520
<i>Blue skies, the ends of the ocean</i>

00:21:36.150 --> 00:21:38.520
<i>aoi sora umi no hate</i>

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:42.610
<i>All that you desire awaits you</i>

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:42.610
<i>nozomu kagiri no subete ga aru kara</i>

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:55.870
<i>The end doesn't exist, that's right</i>

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:55.870
<i>owari nanka nai ze sou sa</i>

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:58.540
<i>We're at our starting point right now</i>

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:58.540
<i>koko wa ima bokura no shuppatsuten</i>

00:21:58.710 --> 00:22:01.170
<i>Blue skies, the ends of the ocean</i>

00:21:58.710 --> 00:22:01.170
<i>aoi sora umi no hate</i>

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:04.760
<i>There's a tomorrow that no one knows about</i>

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:04.760
<i>dare mo shiranai asu wa aru kara</i>

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:06.760
<i>So keep on smiling</i>

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:06.760
<i>waratte iyou</i>

00:22:06.930 --> 00:22:10.720
<i>We're past the point of stopping
In our daily lives</i>

00:22:06.930 --> 00:22:10.720
<i>imasara tachidomarenu bokura no
nichijou jou</i>

00:22:10.890 --> 00:22:12.220
<i>Bring on the unknown!</i>

00:22:10.890 --> 00:22:12.220
<i>michi joutou!</i>

00:22:12.390 --> 00:22:14.560
<i>That day, I drew on the wall with you</i>

00:22:12.390 --> 00:22:14.560
<i>ano hi kimi to kabe ni kaita</i>

00:22:14.730 --> 00:22:17.190
<i>The incomplete, the imperfect</i>

00:22:14.730 --> 00:22:17.190
<i>mikansei wo fukanzen wo</i>

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:19.900
<i>"You can't go anywhere at this point"</i>

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:19.900
<i>imasara doko e mo ikenai ze tte</i>

00:22:20.060 --> 00:22:22.610
<i>Oh, is that so?! Oh, is that so?!</i>

00:22:20.060 --> 00:22:22.610
<i>aa sou kai nee! aa sou kai nee!</i>

00:22:22.780 --> 00:22:28.700
<i>Then we don't want to become a grown-up</i>

00:22:22.780 --> 00:22:28.700
<i>nara otona ni nanka natcha ikenai nee</i>

00:22:31.280 --> 00:22:32.950
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:22:34.200 --> 00:22:35.410
<i>Goddramon.</i>

00:22:35.580 --> 00:22:38.620
<i>This gold dragon mega evolves
from Holyangemon.</i>

00:22:35.580 --> 00:22:38.620
LEVEL: MEGA

00:22:38.790 --> 00:22:40.960
TYPE: HOLY DRAGON

00:22:38.790 --> 00:22:43.300
<i>The God Flame special move instantly
wipes out enemies in every direction!</i>

00:22:41.130 --> 00:22:43.300
SPECIAL MOVE: GOD FLAME

